00:00:00.838 --> 00:00:02.242
- I feel like...

00:00:02.242 --> 00:00:03.390
Hmm.

00:00:03.390 --> 00:00:04.740
With like, anybody in my life,

00:00:04.740 --> 00:00:07.590
I have a lot of intention
with them and they...

00:00:07.590 --> 00:00:09.930
Like, I know I add to
theirs and they add to mine

00:00:09.930 --> 00:00:12.013
and I don't believe in just like,

00:00:12.013 --> 00:00:15.660
being in a romantic
relationship just to be in one.

00:00:15.660 --> 00:00:17.640
And yeah.

00:00:17.640 --> 00:00:19.860
And I think admittedly, I
am like commitment-phobic,

00:00:19.860 --> 00:00:21.987
and I also prefer like...

00:00:21.987 --> 00:00:24.330
I don't know, it's like
something I say a lot,

00:00:24.330 --> 00:00:25.950
but I prefer like short-term relationships

00:00:25.950 --> 00:00:26.783
more than long-term.

00:00:26.783 --> 00:00:29.370
Like, I love when
relationships have an end date

00:00:29.370 --> 00:00:31.140
and I know that's not a popular opinion.

00:00:31.140 --> 00:00:32.940
And I think also, having an end date

00:00:32.940 --> 00:00:34.337
is like reassuring to me

00:00:34.337 --> 00:00:39.270
'cause it's like then you can
make the most of each other

00:00:39.270 --> 00:00:41.309
and cherish each other until the end date.

00:00:41.309 --> 00:00:44.520
But yeah, I also think like
I just haven't met someone

00:00:44.520 --> 00:00:47.163
that I want past the end date.

00:00:48.480 --> 00:00:49.451
Yeah.

00:00:49.451 --> 00:00:51.300
(speaker laughing)

00:00:51.300 --> 00:00:54.063
- I'm single because it's
just like the context

00:00:54.063 --> 00:00:55.697
in which I meet a lot of people,

00:00:55.697 --> 00:00:57.330
and especially in this day and age,

00:00:57.330 --> 00:00:58.530
