00:01:13.260 --> 00:01:16.320
maybe it's also about how
it's hard to meet new people.

00:01:16.320 --> 00:01:17.435
So, I don't know.

00:01:17.435 --> 00:01:18.843
That's mostly about it.

00:01:19.679 --> 00:01:22.926
- I don't feel like I put
myself out there a lot.

00:01:22.926 --> 00:01:26.100
Lack of confidence too,
sometimes, you know?

00:01:26.100 --> 00:01:27.990
